      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This blue whale builds from three pieces: an oval body, two capsule flippers, and two oval tail flukes. The belly is worked in pale blue or white yarn sewn on as a flat oval after assembly. Safety eyes sit just forward of the mid-point on the body."
          }
